{"id":"6d733f353e873b30","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-development-measure-decrease.md","title":"发展步使测度严格下降","display":"lem-development-measure-decrease — 发展步使测度严格下降","type":"lemma","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"lemma","label":"56-lem-development-measure-decrease","aliases":["56-lem-development-measure-decrease"],"display":"lem-development-measure-decrease — 发展步使测度严格下降","depends_on":["[[56-df-development-measure]]","[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]","[[56-df-multiset-extension]]"],"source_section":"§4.4 Proposition 4.4.5; §4.5 Theorem 4.5.4","source_printed_pages":"103,107","source_ocr_blocks":[124,128],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-development-measure-decrease"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-development-measure-decrease</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-development-measure-decrease — 发展步使测度严格下降"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"11abe9c52ceec545\" href=\"?note=11abe9c52ceec545\" title=\"56-df-development-measure\">56-df-development-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"943afdb3e6462a3a\" href=\"?note=943afdb3e6462a3a\" title=\"56-df-multiset-extension\">56-df-multiset-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.4 Proposition 4.4.5; §4.5 Theorem 4.5.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"103,107"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span><span>128</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为正交TRS，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(a=(s,u,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in U\">\\(u\\in U\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ResStep}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{ResStep}_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a>，其红项类型与有限性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNorm}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{DNorm}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"11abe9c52ceec545\" href=\"?note=11abe9c52ceec545\" title=\"56-df-development-measure\">56-df-development-measure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\">\\(&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\)</span> 为自然数严格序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;\">\\(&gt;\\)</span> 的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"943afdb3e6462a3a\" href=\"?note=943afdb3e6462a3a\" title=\"56-df-multiset-extension\">56-df-multiset-extension</a> 提升。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(s,U)\n&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\n\\operatorname{DNorm}_R\\bigl(t,\\operatorname{ResStep}_R(a,U)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(s,U)\n&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\n\\operatorname{DNorm}_R\\bigl(t,\\operatorname{ResStep}_R(a,U)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>记所收缩标记位置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>、其局部 rank 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=\\nu(s,\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U),p)\\ge1\">\\(m=\\nu(s,\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U),p)\\ge1\\)</span>。使用正交残余四类逐项比较：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>该标记本身消失。</li>\n<li>与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 不交的标记、位于其上的标记各保留一个。前者的局部rank不变；后者在新分支上的标记数不增，故rank不增。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 内部所有其他标记都位于所收缩左部的变量实例内；否则该 redex 与左部非变量真位置重叠。它们只能按右部变量叶出现数复制或删除。每个被复制标记的局部rank保持不变，且严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>：源项由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 到它的每条路径还包含被消耗的标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>。右部的新函数符号均无标记，因此不会在任何副本上方增加rank。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对保持rank的单一副本作多重集公共部分消去。剩下被删的非空多重集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 至少包含所收缩标记的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；所有增加的副本rank均小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>，而发生rank下降的外层标记，其新值小于自身被删旧值。删除的内层标记可以无替入。因此所有新增元素都小于某个被删元素，恰满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\">\\(&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\)</span> 的定义。范数按出现数而非集合计数，所以复制不会被漏掉。</p>\n<p>这是原书 underlining 范数下降的逐位置重建；没有用“redex总数下降”这一在复制规则中为假的断言。此引理只针对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in U\">\\(u\\in U\\)</span> 的发展步，不能覆盖任意创建 redex 的收缩。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-development-measure","status":"resolved","id":"11abe9c52ceec545","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-development-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-multiset-extension","status":"resolved","id":"943afdb3e6462a3a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-multiset-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ResStep}_R$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]，其红项类型与有限性见 [[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ResStep}_R$ 见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]，其红项类型与有限性见 [[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-development-measure","status":"resolved","id":"11abe9c52ceec545","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DNorm}_R$、$\\nu$ 见 [[56-df-development-measure]]；$>^{\\mathrm{mul}}$ 为自然数严格序 $>$ 的 [[56-df-multiset-extension]] 提升。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-mul